#                     warp, the area NVK sizes for it, the methods that give it to the raw channel's 3D and compute
#                     classes (the runtime's, never a record's), ahead of every program of the pack or a record
#   raw_view_test     raw/runtime/raw_view.h: a kernel's texture slot binds the texture's own header, or a header of its
