#                     texture's unsigned twin), with no sRGB conversion; texels of another size or blocks bind none
#   raw_tic_words_test  raw/runtime/raw_zeta.h and raw_gpu.cpp's block-compressed rows: each depth/stencil format's
#                     SET_ZT_FORMAT and texture header word 0, and each compressed format's word 0, rebuilt from NIL's
#                     row of NVK's format by NIL's generator rules
#   mkpack_owned_test raw/pack/mkpack.py: no blob or baseline register is one the raw path owns
#   splits_layout_test  raw/pack/splits.py: a split is packed only where its per-pixel program binds its uniform
#                     buffers as its whole program does
#   raw_tiled_cache_test  raw/runtime/raw_tiled_cache.h: with the kernel's tiled-cache bit, deko3d's configuration then the
#                     enable at context init and one flush per pass and per command buffer; nothing without it
#   raw_probe_forms_test  raw/runtime/raw_probe_forms.h and raw_probe_ops.h (hw_test_app's barrier and 2D-engine probes,
#                     debug builds): today's forms are the words the runtime sent before, the relaxed ones never idle and
